      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "AatroxQ",
        "name": "The Darkin Blade",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Aatrox slams his greatsword down, dealing physical damage. He can swing three times, each with a different area of effect.",
        "bodyHtml": "Aatrox slams his greatsword, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/25/40/55/70 + (60/67.5/75/82.5/90% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. If they are hit on the edge, they are briefly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Up</span> and they take <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(17.5/43.75/70/96.25/122.5 + (105/118.125/131.25/144.375/157.5% Attack Damage))</span> instead. This Ability can be <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> twice, each one changing shape and dealing 25% more damage than the previous one.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 70% damage to minions.<br /><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Up</span> duration against monsters is doubled and it deals 25 bonus damage.</span>",
