        "slot": "W",
        "id": "AatroxW",
        "name": "Infernal Chains",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Aatrox smashes the ground, dealing damage to the first enemy hit. Champions and large monsters have to leave the impact area quickly or they will be dragged to the center and take the damage again.",
        "bodyHtml": "Aatrox fires a chain, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> the first enemy hit by 25/27.5/30/32.5/35% for 1.5 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/40/50/60/70 + (40% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. Champions and large jungle monsters have 1.5 seconds to leave the impact area or be <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pulled</span> back to the center and damaged again for the same amount.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals double damage to minions.</span>",
